# game/script2.rpy:3072
translate brazil flinkmansionskip_60ec45dd:

#   mc "I'm just curious because I thought maybe you’d be hiding a birthmark or something, as I know some people are self-conscious about that kind of stuff... but you weren't wearing any gloves inside Eternum."
    mc "Só estou curioso porque pensei que talvez você estivesse escondendo uma marca de nascença ou algo assim, pois sei que algumas pessoas ficam constrangidas com esse tipo de coisa... mas você não estava usando luvas dentro de Eternum."

# game/script2.rpy:3073
translate brazil flinkmansionskip_0a1b404f:

#   mc "And I know it's a rather weird compliment to give to someone, but you have beautiful hands."
