#   mc "PTA? Never heard of it. Is that like the... Pakistan Telecommunication Authority or something?" with dissolve
    mc "PTA? Nunca ouvi falar disso. É como a... Autoridade de Telecomunicações do Paquistão ou algo assim?" with dissolve

# game/script2.rpy:4873
translate brazil nancygym_03b81400:

#   ger "You know, maybe Nancy would also hear more compliments if she ever left her lab!" with dissolve
    ger "Você sabe, talvez Nancy também ouvisse mais elogios se algum dia saísse do laboratório!" with dissolve

# game/script2.rpy:4875
translate brazil nancygym_0d32beb5:

#   n "Well, the most recent Ulysses contract has been keeping me very busy, you know." with dissolve
    n "Bem, o contrato mais recente do Ulysses tem me mantido muito ocupado, você sabe." with dissolve

# game/script2.rpy:4877
translate brazil nancygym_e19c8db3:

#   mc "Ulysses? Eternum's parent company? I thought you worked in the research field." with dissolve
    mc "Ulisses? Empresa-mãe da Eternum? Achei que você trabalhava na área de pesquisa." with dissolve

# game/script2.rpy:4879
translate brazil nancygym_e83c1c47:

#   n "I do! They actually hired us to conduct a stem cell study a few weeks ago. I guess when you’re the largest conglomerate on the planet, you become involved in many sectors." with dissolve
