# game/script2.rpy:4880
translate brazil nancygym_f9b949da:

#   n "I heard they're also planning to get into the narcotics industry soon."
    n "Ouvi dizer que eles também planejam entrar na indústria de narcóticos em breve."

# game/script2.rpy:4882
translate brazil nancygym_a8385250:

#   mc "Damn... technology, entertainment, banking... and now science too? These people have their hands in everything!" with dissolve
    mc "Droga... tecnologia, entretenimento, bancos... e agora ciência também? Essa gente tem a mão em tudo!" with dissolve

# game/script2.rpy:4884
translate brazil nancygym_c10d8f29:

#   n "But... if you're wondering if I can get a free neural implant as a perk of the job, I can't. We're just one of hundreds of subcontracts they have." with dissolve
